  "description": "Eternal Oud by Lattafa opens with rich top notes of plum and grapefruit, offering a unique mix of dark fruit and bright citrus. In the heart, heliotrope and orchid unfold, adding a soft floral layer that gently balances the bold opening. The base wraps the scent in creamy vanilla, warm amber, labdanum, benzoin, tonka bean and smooth oud — delivering a deep, lasting finish with luxurious depth and sophistication. Overall, this fragrance is a modern oriental woody blend with a fruity opening and a rich, resinous, comforting dry-down.",
